Package: loscolores
Title: Engineering-Grade Perceptual Color Systems
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Raimundo", "Sanchez", email = "raimundosanchezu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A perceptual color system builder based on OKLab. From any reference colours it derives two neutral poles and five core colours with a guaranteed luminance ladder (the system reads in greyscale), keeps the first colour as an exact anchor, and provides categorical, sequential and divergent palettes. Same engine as the web tool at <https://loscolores.raimundos.cl>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://loscolores.raimundos.cl, https://github.com/raimun2/loscolores
